# eci_virtual_machine (Resource)

Manages an ECI virtual machine. Creating this resource defines the VM spec (name, instance type, pricing, credentials) but does **not** start the VM.

-> **NOTE:** To start the VM, create an [`eci_virtual_machine_allocation`](virtual_machine_allocation) resource that references it. Before starting, ensure a boot disk ([`eci_block_storage`](block_storage) with `image_id`) and a network interface ([`eci_network_interface`](network_interface)) are attached.

